//===- KernelFrameworkDispatchAPIs.def - Dispatch-level WDF operations ----===//
//
// NeverD Decompiler
//
//===----------------------------------------------------------------------===//
/// Request operations whose guest DDI permits DISPATCH_LEVEL. Any resulting
/// passive object, queue or power callbacks are dispatched by a worker.
/// Interrupt DDIs validate their own lock and resource IRQL separately.
//===----------------------------------------------------------------------===//

